<title>USA: Empresas ICA in $199 mln Panama contract.</title>
<headline>Empresas ICA in $199 mln Panama contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV said Thursday it has signed a contract worth $199 million to participate in the construction of a hydroelectric plant in Panama.</p>
<p>The company said the contract is divided between it and General Electric Co's General Electric Canada unit, with Empresas ICA owning 69 percent.</p>
<p>The project will begin in September and take about 46 months to complete, it said.</p>
<p>The contract was issued by the Instituto do Recursos Hidraulicos y Electrificacion of Panama, the company said.</p>
